        "name": "Devour",
        "subtype": "ability",
        "text": "The target is trapped by the flytrap\u2019s jaws, gaining the grabbed condition until it Escapes (DC 21). Additionally, it is exposed to the titanic flytrap toxin from the hundreds of tiny hairs that line the inside of its leaves. If the flytrap\u2019s jaws Strike was a critical success, the target takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to its saving throws against this poison. At the end of each of the target\u2019s turns that it remains grabbed, the target takes 3d6 acid damage.",
